{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Rebuilding Civilization&quot;</strong> \u2013 This is a survival, development, and construction game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of war and catastrophe, the remnants of humanity gather on a desolate land. As their leader, you must guide your people in rebuilding civilization from scratch amid scarce resources and lost technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 1: Choose the Starting Location</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide to settle the first group of survivors near a lush plain. With ample water, fertile soil for crops, and open terrain for defense, this location is ideal. Using wood and stone, you build simple shelters and send out scouts to explore the surrounding area for resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/c3280839b3037a9cf3aba456a66971b4.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/c3280839b3037a9cf3aba456a66971b4.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/c3280839b3037a9cf3aba456a66971b4.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 2: Gather Resources &amp; Construct Facilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, survival depends on foraging and hunting. But as the population grows, you begin logging, quarrying stone, and constructing sturdier houses and storage. A basic mill is built to process grain, while the establishment of a blacksmith allows for the crafting of tools and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/a2431a1625b762a6053b94cfb0a152dd.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/a2431a1625b762a6053b94cfb0a152dd.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/a2431a1625b762a6053b94cfb0a152dd.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 3: Develop the Village &amp; Establish Transportation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With improved productivity, scattered camps gradually merge into a small village. You lay dirt roads to connect nearby resource points and begin trading with distant settlements for scarce supplies. The emergence of commerce kickstarts the economy, further expanding the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/08f6a25a2dc62e564846ec0efde3dca4.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/08f6a25a2dc62e564846ec0efde3dca4.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/08f6a25a2dc62e564846ec0efde3dca4.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 4: Secure Resources &amp; Manufacture Goods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To sustain growth, you clear more farmland and attempt to domesticate livestock. Handicrafts become specialized\u2014pottery, textiles, and simple metalworks are produced, meeting internal needs and becoming valuable trade goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/29ee7f8e3761681cb5c43b961a8473ab.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/29ee7f8e3761681cb5c43b961a8473ab.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/29ee7f8e3761681cb5c43b961a8473ab.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/9b59512cfe6b934d615bcbd566727ab3.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/9b59512cfe6b934d615bcbd566727ab3.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/9b59512cfe6b934d615bcbd566727ab3.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 5: Expand Trade &amp; Defend Against Threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the village prospers, raiders take notice. You build walls, train militia, and form alliances through trade. Merchant caravans travel farther, eventually discovering larger surviving settlements. The spark of civilization reignites, bringing new hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/929498820bfcd3cdbc8526328ff8f5ec.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/929498820bfcd3cdbc8526328ff8f5ec.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/929498820bfcd3cdbc8526328ff8f5ec.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under your leadership, this once-doomed group not only recovers its population but also rekindles the dawn of civilization. Yet greater challenges lie ahead\u2014should you expand further or consolidate your gains? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813160?t=1767462034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813160?t=1767462034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/283a7040144e8aab36d93ae6c8da2b26d8747d70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767462034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/283a7040144e8aab36d93ae6c8da2b26d8747d70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767462034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3814330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Rebuilding Civilization&quot;</strong> \u2013 This is a survival, development, and construction game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of war and catastrophe, the remnants of humanity gather on a desolate land. As their leader, you must guide your people in rebuilding civilization from scratch amid scarce resources and lost technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 1: Choose the Starting Location</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide to settle the first group of survivors near a lush plain. With ample water, fertile soil for crops, and open terrain for defense, this location is ideal. Using wood and stone, you build simple shelters and send out scouts to explore the surrounding area for resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/c3280839b3037a9cf3aba456a66971b4.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/c3280839b3037a9cf3aba456a66971b4.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/c3280839b3037a9cf3aba456a66971b4.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 2: Gather Resources &amp; Construct Facilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, survival depends on foraging and hunting. But as the population grows, you begin logging, quarrying stone, and constructing sturdier houses and storage. A basic mill is built to process grain, while the establishment of a blacksmith allows for the crafting of tools and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/a2431a1625b762a6053b94cfb0a152dd.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/a2431a1625b762a6053b94cfb0a152dd.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/a2431a1625b762a6053b94cfb0a152dd.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 3: Develop the Village &amp; Establish Transportation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With improved productivity, scattered camps gradually merge into a small village. You lay dirt roads to connect nearby resource points and begin trading with distant settlements for scarce supplies. The emergence of commerce kickstarts the economy, further expanding the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/08f6a25a2dc62e564846ec0efde3dca4.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/08f6a25a2dc62e564846ec0efde3dca4.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/08f6a25a2dc62e564846ec0efde3dca4.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 4: Secure Resources &amp; Manufacture Goods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To sustain growth, you clear more farmland and attempt to domesticate livestock. Handicrafts become specialized\u2014pottery, textiles, and simple metalworks are produced, meeting internal needs and becoming valuable trade goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/29ee7f8e3761681cb5c43b961a8473ab.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/29ee7f8e3761681cb5c43b961a8473ab.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/29ee7f8e3761681cb5c43b961a8473ab.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/9b59512cfe6b934d615bcbd566727ab3.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/9b59512cfe6b934d615bcbd566727ab3.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/9b59512cfe6b934d615bcbd566727ab3.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 5: Expand Trade &amp; Defend Against Threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the village prospers, raiders take notice. You build walls, train militia, and form alliances through trade. Merchant caravans travel farther, eventually discovering larger surviving settlements. The spark of civilization reignites, bringing new hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/929498820bfcd3cdbc8526328ff8f5ec.poster.avif?t=1767462034\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/929498820bfcd3cdbc8526328ff8f5ec.webm?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/extras/929498820bfcd3cdbc8526328ff8f5ec.mp4?t=1767462034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under your leadership, this once-doomed group not only recovers its population but also rekindles the dawn of civilization. Yet greater challenges lie ahead\u2014should you expand further or consolidate your gains? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["kanyu studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813160/0898b4a08e45235cc80e98aaf0e547fd3618e43d/header.jpg?t=1767462034","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Any assets in the game belong to our studio, and no one is allowed to decompile them, otherwise they will bear legal consequences","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3813160/1223252591/bcc18a743ed3225f7699c176d34e13f5d95a00ec/1750365301/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749831853","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3813160/1223252591/bcc18a743ed3225f7699c176d34e13f5d95a00ec/1750365301/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749831853","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3813160/1223252591/bcc18a743ed3225f7699c176d34e13f5d95a00ec/1750365301/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749831853","id":257155352,"name":"RebuildingCivilization","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155352/32f02d8e73a91eb23e43d3f1aebfd0a28091bbb0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749831853"}],"name":"\u91cd\u5851\u6587\u660e Rebuilding Civilization","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K/KF or equivalent AMD-Hardware<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX2070 or equivalent AMD-Hardware<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></